  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Point of Care Testing ( POC ) &#x2018;iSTAT&#x2019; (portable blood analysis system)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project would allow the hospital to obtain rapid laboratory results (in minutes) in critical patients requiring rapid decision and treatment. The main beneficiaries will be children up to the age of 15 who are in need of critical care. The majority of the funding would be used to purchase an &#x2018;iSTAT&#x2019; which is a handheld device that is portable and provides the ability to obtain rapid diagnostic testing by the bedside.  Will make a big difference when dealing with critically ill patients.</narrative>
  </description>
